WEBVTT

00:05:28.741 --> 00:05:31.410
Each glass drawer holds a manuscript.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:36.540
100 years is not vast in cosmic terms.

00:05:36.874 --> 00:05:40.211
Yet if my young son
lives to read the books,

00:05:40.211 --> 00:05:43.923
his world is likely to have changed
beyond recognition.

00:05:44.382 --> 00:05:47.134
Will human beings survive
to read the books?

00:05:47.802 --> 00:05:50.679
Future Library is a century-long prayer.

00:05:51.347 --> 00:05:54.183
Future generations
may be invisible to our eyes,

00:05:54.183 --> 00:05:56.811
but we are connected through our actions.

00:05:57.645 --> 00:05:59.563
I wanted to see to future readers,

00:05:59.563 --> 00:06:00.606
“I see you.”